  - "Hareket tu\u015Flar\u0131 veya sol \xE7ubukla i\u015Farete ula\u015F."
  - "Sol fare tu\u015Fu, Bo\u015Fluk veya kumandan\u0131n alt tu\u015Fuyla ate\u015F
    et."
  - "\u0130\u015Faretli silaha yakla\u015F ve E'ye ya da kumandan\u0131n sol y\xFCz
    tu\u015Funa bas."
  - "1, 2 veya kumandan\u0131n omuz tu\u015Flar\u0131yla di\u011Fer yuvaya ge\xE7."
  - "Ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n silah\u0131 b\u0131rakmak i\xE7in bulundu\u011Fu yuvan\u0131n
    tu\u015Funu bas\u0131l\u0131 tut."
  - "Ni\u015Fan almak i\xE7in G'ye veya sol teti\u011Fe bas, sonra hedef se\xE7.
    At\u0131\u015Fla ilk dalga ba\u015Flar."
  - "\u0130lk dalgay\u0131 yen ve bir geli\u015Ftirme kart\u0131 se\xE7."
  - "Dalgalar aras\u0131nda bekle veya sonrakini ba\u015Flatmak i\xE7in Atla'ya bas."
  - "Menzilli subay\u0131 izle. Sald\u0131r\u0131 uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCnce
    ate\u015F hatt\u0131ndan \xE7\u0131k. Sonucu g\xF6rmek i\xE7in dalgay\u0131 bitir."
  - "\u0130\u015Farete ula\u015F"
  - "Ate\u015F etmek i\xE7in sa\u011F \xE7ubu\u011Fu hareket ettir veya tek \xE7ubuk
    modunda sald\u0131r\u0131 tu\u015Funa dokun."
  - "\u0130\u015Faretli silaha yakla\u015F ve etkile\u015Fim tu\u015Funa dokun."
  - "Di\u011Fer silah yuvas\u0131na dokun."
  - "El bombas\u0131 tu\u015Funa, sonra hedefe dokun. At\u0131\u015Fla ilk dalga
    ba\u015Flar."
  - "Oyun ipu\xE7lar\u0131"
  - "\u0130lk b\xF6l\xFCme ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in Desert\u2019i sat\u0131n al."
  - "\u0130PUCU"
  - "Susturucu at\u0131\u015F sesini azalt\u0131r; seni daha az canavar duyar."
  - "Menzilli subay uzaktan sald\u0131r\u0131r. Sald\u0131r\u0131dan \xF6nce i\u015Faretli
    alandan \xE7\u0131k."
  - "\u015Eaman d\xFC\u015Fen canavarlar\u0131 diriltir. Takviyeyi durdurmak i\xE7in
    \u015Faman\u0131 alt et."
  - "Z\u0131rhl\u0131 d\xFC\u015Fman \xF6nden daha az hasar al\u0131r. Yandan ya
    da arkadan vur."
  - "\u015Eampiyonlar\u0131n \xF6zel \xF6zellikleri onlar\u0131 s\u0131radan canavarlardan
    daha tehlikeli k\u0131lar."
  - "Kanca seni kendine \xE7ekebilir. Sald\u0131r\u0131ya haz\u0131rlan\u0131rken
    yana ka\xE7."
  - "\xD6d\xFCl\xFC almak i\xE7in s\u0131radan sand\u0131\u011F\u0131 a\xE7."
  - "Kilitli sand\u0131k anahtar ister. \u0130\xE7inde daha nadir bir silah var."
  - "Bu sand\u0131k \u015Fampiyonlar\u0131 \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131r. \xD6d\xFCl
    i\xE7in onlar\u0131 yen."
  - "Bu anahtar kilitli sand\u0131\u011F\u0131 a\xE7ar."
  - "Kubbe canavarlar\u0131 uzak tutar ve can yeniler. Dalga s\u0131ras\u0131nda
    i\xE7eride kalma s\xFCresi s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131d\u0131r."
  - "Etkisini tetiklemek i\xE7in varile ate\u015F et. Patlarken uzak dur."
  - "Canavarlara \xE7arpmak i\xE7in araca bin. \xC7ok hasar al\u0131rsa ara\xE7 bozulur."
  - "Boss sald\u0131r\u0131lar\u0131 \xF6nceden i\u015Faretlenir. Sald\u0131r\u0131dan
    \xF6nce i\u015Faretli alandan \xE7\u0131k."
  - "Boss yenilene kadar arena kilitli kal\u0131r. Kapal\u0131 arenayla b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC
    bitirmek ek \xF6d\xFCl verir."
  - "Kat de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in merdivene \xE7\u0131k. Canavarlar seni takip
    edebilir."
  - Gargoyl
  - "Gargoyl dal\u0131\u015Fa ge\xE7meden g\xF6lgeden \xE7\u0131k. Ta\u015F derisi
    birka\xE7 saniye boyunca hasar\u0131n \xE7o\u011Funu emer."
  - Sessiz Av
  - "Silah sesi menzili \u221240%."
  - Son Mermi
  - "Son mermi +50% hasar (tek at\u0131\u015Fl\u0131 silahta +15%)."
  - Zincirleme Tepki
  - "Patlamayla \xF6ld\xFCrme en yak\u0131n canavara 2 m i\xE7inde 40 hasar verir.
    Patlama ba\u015F\u0131na bir kez."
  - Lanetliler
  - "Silah vuru\u015Fu 4 sn i\u015Faretler. \u0130\u015Faretli hedefe sonraki vuru\u015Flar
    +15% hasar verir."
  - "So\u011Fukkanl\u0131"
  - "3 sn hasar almay\u0131nca kritik \u015Fans\u0131, hasar alana dek 10 y\xFCzde
    puan artar."
  - "Ka\xE7ak"
  - "Hasar al\u0131nca 2 sn hareket h\u0131z\u0131 +25%. Bekleme 8 sn."
  - "\xD6fke"
  - "\xD6ld\xFCrme ba\u015F\u0131na 3 sn +4% at\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131, en \xE7ok
    be\u015F birikim. \xD6ld\xFCrmeler s\xFCreyi yeniler."
  - "D\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCc\xFC"
  - "Uyumsuz cephane etkin silah\u0131n temel \u015Farj\xF6r\xFCn\xFCn d\xF6rtte
    birine d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCr (en az bir mermi). \u0130lk d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCmden
    sonra m\u0131knat\u0131s da d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr."
  - "K\u0131yma Makinesi"
  - "Yak\u0131n d\xF6v\xFC\u015Fte \xF6ld\xFCrme sonras\u0131 2 sn i\xE7indeki ilk
    yak\u0131n sald\u0131r\u0131 %40 daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r."
  - Vampir
  - "Silahla d\xFC\u015F\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFCn sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n %3\u2019\xFCn\xFC
    kazan\u0131rs\u0131n. Saniyede en \xE7ok 10 CP."
  - Cellat
  - "Evrim: kritik hasar \xD73."
  - "Yayl\u0131m"
  - "Evrim: her at\u0131\u015F %20 olas\u0131l\u0131kla mermiyi \u015Farj\xF6rde
    tutar."
  - "Par\xE7al\u0131 Bomba"
  - "Evrim: el bombas\u0131 \xFC\xE7 kez patlar. Her biri %45 temel hasar ve 1,25
    m yar\u0131\xE7ap."
  - Cehennem
  - "Evrim: yanan canavar \xF6l\xFCnce patlar. 1,5 m i\xE7inde 60 hasar."
  - "\u25C6"
  - "Fla\u015F bombas\u0131 \xF6nce sersemletir, sonra k\xF6r eder."
  - "Aya\u011F\u0131na may\u0131n koymak i\xE7in F\u0131rlat\u2019a bas. Yar\u0131m
    saniyede kurulur."
  - "Evrim i\xE7in ayn\u0131 \u25C6 numaral\u0131 iki kart\u0131 en y\xFCksek seviyeye
